    "title": "Megan Thee Stallion Goes Bold in Leotard & Sheer Tights for Dunkin' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evolve Editors ,\n2 hours ago Photo Credit: Thearon W. Henderson/Getty Images Megan Thee Stallion is bringing bold fashion energy to Dunkin ‘s latest Instagram campaign. The rapper-songwriter appears in a vibrant studio-style ad, wearing a striking pink-and-orange leotard layered with sheer tights that highlight her signature confident aesthetic. The form-fitting bodysuit features glossy panels and contrast piping, looking sporty yet playful and perfectly matching the brand’s colourful visual world.\nMegan Thee Stallion stuns in leotard, crop top, and sheer tights in Dunkin’ ad The 30-year-old completes the outfit with coordinating leg warmers and platform sneakers, leaning into a retro-inspired workout vibe. Throughout the video, Megan moves across a circular stage alongside backup dancers dressed in matching pink-toned sets. Thus creating a synchronised, high-energy performance moment. The saturated backdrop, warm lighting, and Dunkin’ cup props further amplify the campaign’s larger-than-life fun.\nThe look blends athletic styling with glamour, proving Megan Thee Stallion can turn branded content into a full fashion statement, one that feels unmistakably her.\nOriginally reported by Viha Shah on The Fashion Spot .\nThe post Megan Thee Stallion Goes Bold in Leotard & Sheer Tights for Dunkin’ appeared first on Mandatory .",
